extraStrings:
- type: en-US
  strings: &id001
    STR_ARASHIKAGE_ARROW: Arashikage Arrow
    STR_ARASHIKAGE_ARROW_UFOPEDIA: 'SCARLETT: Hand-made, bamboo shaft, the fletching cut from a hawk''s flight feathers. Nobody has made an arrow like this in Japan for a hundred years, except one family.{NEWLINE}{NEWLINE}The
      Arashikage. Ninja, for six hundred years. Cobra has bought itself an assassin, and he works for honour, not money. That makes him harder to buy back.'
    STR_MARS_PROTOTYPE: M.A.R.S. Prototype
    STR_MARS_PROTOTYPE_UFOPEDIA: 'ROADBLOCK: Seized off Destro''s own firing range. Beautiful work, every part machined in Scotland, every part stamped M.A.R.S.{NEWLINE}{NEWLINE}Take it apart and we know
      how M.A.R.S. builds, what it fails at and what it needs to work. Every M.A.R.S. weapon Cobra carries from now on has the same weak points.'
    STR_BRAINWAVE_MACHINE: Brainwave Machine
    STR_BRAINWAVE_MACHINE_UFOPEDIA: 'DOC: A chair, a helmet and a lot of wiring. It doesn''t erase a mind. It quiets it, until it does what it''s told.{NEWLINE}{NEWLINE}Now we know the frequency, we can
      shield against it, and we can bring people back faster. Mindbender will build a better one. This one taught us how he thinks.'
- type: en-GB
  strings: *id001
